<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Match cost cuts to help in 97/98.</title>
<headline>Swedish Match cost cuts to help in 97/98.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish tobacco company Swedish Match AB said on Monday an ongoing cost-cutting programme would positively affect its 1997 result but would not take full effect until 1998.</p>
</text>
